{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-15f0df24b0f7e32f17f8160efe6620d2","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0002","observation_sha256":"60821a89e5acb789243ccfb5846d5d1c2e4cc5d75d422ec1d367e96b0fee0201","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-15f0df24b0f7e32f17f8160efe6620d2","key_id":"9c0a4056d4774161df0c119222dc2b090f885be269e4b224ed99054e3c61f738","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","receipt_mac":"856c901fc16446d3fd1b318fb556a77651b2ae269e45ac0c97373ff69ab12721","result_sha256":"287d6e10d42a4797a31154b71f7d137c150bd3a119294ce2c2f0e6353efdf50f","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":80,"path":"/memories","pattern":"expand|branch|franchise|grow|scale|new (store|location|market)"},"content":"/memories/session-01.md:L25: Calvin: I'm so excited to learn about Japanese culture and get a chance to expand.\n/memories/session-06.md:L43: Calvin: Thanks Dave! Super excited for my upcoming performance in Tokyo this month. It's gonna be great to show my music to a whole new crowd and hopefully expand my following!\n/memories/session-11.md:L29: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! It feels great having my own space to work in. I've been experimenting with different genres lately, pushing myself out of my comfort zone. Adding electronic elements to my songs gives them a fresh vibe. It's been an exciting process of self-discovery and growth!\n/memories/session-11.md:L32: Dave: Wow, Calvin, that's great! It must be an exciting process of self-discovery and growth to experiment with different genres. Does moving between styles present any challenges?\n/memories/session-12.md:L15: Dave: Hey Calvin, I understand the stress of getting a car serviced. Fixing cars is like therapy for me. Growing up working on cars with my dad, refurbishing them gives me a sense of fulfillment.\n/memories/session-12.md:L44: Calvin: My plan for now is to expand my brand worldwide and grow my fanbase. I want my music to reach more people and make an impact. Working with artists from around the globe and challenging myself to create special music are goals of mine too. Look at the photo of how I performed with the boys last night, they are great at the music!\n/memories/session-14.md:L18: Dave: It's always great to learn and grow. So, what have you been up to lately?\n/memories/session-14.md:L59: Calvin: You got this, Dave! I'm always here for you. Seeing your enthusiasm is amazing. Keep growing, buddy. It'll be worth it! Good luck with that. See ya!\n/memories/session-18.md:L30: Calvin: Thanks Dave! Lots of cool stuff happening. Next up, a tour - so excited! After that, I'm off to explore and grow my brand. Can't wait to see what the future has in store!\n/memories/session-21.md:L46: Calvin: Yeah, those little wins matter. They give us a sense of accomplishment and bring us joy. It's truly inspiring to see how much we can grow.\n/memories/session-21.md:L52: Calvin: Yeah, hard work and dedication are definitely key to reaching our goals and potential. It's awesome to see our growth and progress.\n/memories/session-28.md:L33: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! It's an awesome feeling. Creating something that people connect with and brings joy is what I'm all about. Moments like this really motivate me to keep growing!\n/memories/session-28.md:L127: Dave: Yes, Calvin, writing lyrics and notes - that's awesome! It will boost my motivation! Writing lyrics boosts my motivation to grow!\n/memories/session-29.md:L31: Calvin: Having supportive people is key for me to grow as an artist. They motivate me to get better and stay true to myself. Having support is vital, especially in this tough music industry. Take a look at this photo!\n/memories/session-29.md:L60: Dave: Awesome, Calvin! Experimenting and pushing boundaries is key to making our art grow. Can't wait to see where these new ideas take you!\n/memories/session-29.md:L63: Calvin: Yeah, it's exciting to see where these new ideas lead. It's all about growing and evolving! Have a good one. I need to go now. Take care, Dave!\n/memories/session-29.md:L66: Dave: For sure, Calvin! Growing and evolving is key for any artist. Don't stop pushing yourself and keep exploring. Can't wait to see what you come up with next! See ya Cal! Take care!","content_sha256":"aff4c25ac833d13479e146e9a42c45a93af6403f86a5e0954f981e4e806218b9","coverage":[{"line_end":25,"line_start":25,"path":"/memories/session-01.md"},{"line_end":43,"line_start":43,"path":"/memories/session-06.md"},{"line_end":29,"line_start":29,"path":"/memories/session-11.md"},{"line_end":32,"line_start":32,"path":"/memories/session-11.md"},{"line_end":15,"line_start":15,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"},{"line_end":44,"line_start":44,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"},{"line_end":18,"line_start":18,"path":"/memories/session-14.md"},{"line_end":59,"line_start":59,"path":"/memories/session-14.md"},{"line_end":30,"line_start":30,"path":"/memories/session-18.md"},{"line_end":46,"line_start":46,"path":"/memories/session-21.md"},{"line_end":52,"line_start":52,"path":"/memories/session-21.md"},{"line_end":33,"line_start":33,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"},{"line_end":127,"line_start":127,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"},{"line_end":31,"line_start":31,"path":"/memories/session-29.md"},{"line_end":60,"line_start":60,"path":"/memories/session-29.md"},{"line_end":63,"line_start":63,"path":"/memories/session-29.md"},{"line_end":66,"line_start":66,"path":"/memories/session-29.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":17,"res