{"action_ordinal":5,"episode_id":"r1ep-15f0df24b0f7e32f17f8160efe6620d2","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0005","observation_sha256":"37baa9b5853b5cac3847e022f1874e9a99e1b4c057a82c751b4029af2efce5b2","ordinal":5,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":5,"episode_id":"r1ep-15f0df24b0f7e32f17f8160efe6620d2","key_id":"9c0a4056d4774161df0c119222dc2b090f885be269e4b224ed99054e3c61f738","ordinal":5,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","receipt_mac":"1626badfc3dd02bb3974e24541e416078dbb83aba8512db64e998d7530d4058b","result_sha256":"1a2458e607e73de74a41abb32affed68bbb64e7d3079539b6b9dfd55ebe11e46","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":36,"path":"/memories/session-18.md","start_line":24},"content":"L24: Calvin: Yeah, moments like this remind me why I got into music - making a difference and sharing my own story. It's exciting to get positive feedback and it gives me strength to keep going and reach more people. My journey's just getting started!\nL25: [S18T5] (dia_id: D18:5)\nL26: \nL27: Dave: Wow, Calvin! You've come a long way since we started talking music. What's next for you? Anything exciting coming up?\nL28: [S18T6] (dia_id: D18:6)\nL29: \nL30: Calvin: Thanks Dave! Lots of cool stuff happening. Next up, a tour - so excited! After that, I'm off to explore and grow my brand. Can't wait to see what the future has in store!\nL31: [S18T7] (dia_id: D18:7)\nL32: \nL33: Dave: Wow, Calvin! Congrats on the upcoming tour! Can't wait to see you perform. Do you have any cities or venues in mind?\nL34: [S18T8] (dia_id: D18:8)\nL35: \nL36: Calvin: Yay! Dave! We're hitting some awesome spots - it's gonna be epic!","content_sha256":"0253c89ef1e13b8a30dc3808fc7329a6847493efc31438d0213f67757e9865fa","coverage":[{"line_end":36,"line_start":24,"path":"/memories/session-18.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":13,"result_sha256":"1a2458e607e73de74a41abb32affed68bbb64e7d3079539b6b9dfd55ebe11e46","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
